      "message": "We\u0027ve landed https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/1032616 a couple of months ago to add fill-rule support.  It\u0027s a somewhat tricky solution to minimize the blast radius compared to the more straightforward approach in your CL.\n\nInterestingly, it doesn\u0027t seem to work in the *web/wasm* build of Skottie (https://skottie.skia.org/1f5ed006a2da4e5102a4911f2e098953?h\u003d256\u0026w\u003d256), but it does work in native builds (https://imgur.com/a/IieupOl).  We need to look into what\u0027s going on there (old wasm build? webgl bindings bug?).\n\nI don\u0027t have access to the linked drive files in your CL - do you mind making them public so we can verify that your tests also pass with our current impl?",
